Subject: [PATCH] sprd: bindings support for UMS512

Consolidated from beebono/linux-mainline-sprd rg-rotate 464b3e7bf45bb300e190339977abba36c8078e1f, rebased onto Linux 7.1.2.
Original authors and patch hashes are recorded in series-origin.json.

